  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a group of political figures on a debate stage, overlaid with text listing derogatory labels: 'a indian', 'a socialist', 'a smeller', 'a mistress', 'a homosexual', and 'a terrorist lover'. These labels are inherently dehumanizing and offensive, targeting individuals based on protected characteristics including race (Indian), political ideology (socialist), sexual orientation (homosexual), and association with terrorism. The juxtaposition of these harmful stereotypes with the image of prominent political figures is intended to provoke outrage or ridicule by associating them with these negative traits. This constitutes a hateful meme as it directly attacks individuals based on their identity and affiliations, using inflammatory and discriminatory language to demean them. The meme's intent is to spread misinformation and incite prejudice against these individuals and their supporters, leveraging the visual context of a political debate to amplify the impact of the hateful content.",
